[38;5;231m⏺[39m I added a checkbox to [38;5;153mindex.html[39m. It's a native [38;5;153m<input type="checkbox">[39m inside a [38;5;153m<label>[39m, so clicking either the box
  or the text toggles it on and off. I also added one small CSS rule that strikes through the label text and greys it
  out when the box is checked, so a done item looks done. I haven't opened it in a browser.

  There's no JavaScript, so the checked state resets when the page reloads. The label "My task" is placeholder text. If
  you want the state to survive a reload (for example with [38;5;153mlocalStorage[39m) or a way to add more tasks, I can add that.

